      "effect": "Special Summon 1 \"Umbral Horror\" monster or \"Masquerade\" Xyz Monster from your hand or GY, then you can make the Levels of all \"Umbral Horror\" monsters you control become the Level of 1 \"Umbral Horror\" monster in your field or GY. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Xyz Monster you control; attach 1 \"Number\" Xyz Monster from your Extra Deck or GY to it. You can only use each effect of \"Barian's Hope\" once per turn.",
